# Inside a done task, an open child due in the past is not overdue, and a child done long ago stays out of the Logbook while one done today inside an old project is in it.
file <<END
- Parent task @done({today-1})
	- Child overdue @due({today-2})
	- Child done @done({today-10})
Old: @done({today-20})
	- Recent done @done({today})
END
keys gO
see 󰨱 Overdue
hide Child overdue
keys gL
see ▌ ✔ Recent done  Old
see ✔ Parent task
hide Child done
hide Old:
